# The elevated hub token (mcp-hub design §2). Presented instead of HUB_SERVICE_TOKEN when set, so the
# hub may elevate the triggering human's envelope to `verified` — required for D14-14's
# approvals.resolveExecute, i.e. for any agent high_write to ever resume. Unset ⇒ writes stay denied.
HUB_ASSURANCE_TOKEN=

